# a real folder where a skill's link goes stops the install before anything is written
spec: Skills
args: skills install
exit: 2
-- .claude/skills/necro-rules/SKILL.md --
---
name: necro-rules
description: mine
---
-- @stderr --
necro: skills: .claude/skills/necro-rules is a folder, not a link; move it to .agents/skills/necro-rules or remove it, then run again
-- @file .agents/skills/necro/SKILL.md --
